OL,3,ATech stocks fall after calls for AI
OL,4,Adevelopment to slow down
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after Jacob Coxon, an
OL,7,Fartificial intelligence researcher who
OL,8,Fquit Anthropic, told the BBC staff
OL,9,Fdeveloping AI systems were "genuinely
OL,10,Ffrightened" for the future of humanity
OL,12,FUS President Trump has downplayed the
OL,13,Fthreat, saying "whoever wins AI, wins";
OL,14,FChina's foreign ministry spokesperson
OL,15,Fsays "all parties should work together
OL,16,Fto foster an AI landscape that is open,
OL,17,Finclusive, universally beneficial"
